# inlang Paraglide: the generated message code (regenerated at prepare/build time
# via compile:i18n + the Vite plugin) and inlang's transient project files (cache,
# .meta.json, README) are ignored. Only settings.json is tracked; the message
# catalogs live in messages/{locale}.json (tracked).
src/lib/paraglide/
project.inlang/*
!project.inlang/settings.json
